      "notes": "The MIDI CC table (PDF page 9), read by tools/profiles/gamechanger/read-pedal-cc.mjs from WEB_Auto_Chorus_AMCH_QuickGuide2.pdf (sha256 c72fa533fbdc88aa83a007b5331e9da36bd6f6d16e22272b7256d3864bf986d1), https://gamechangeraudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/WEB_Auto_Chorus_AMCH_QuickGuide2.pdf, linked from https://gamechangeraudio.com/auto/. Not yet checked against the pedal itself."
    }
